# Scratch/staging area for model files at the repo root, kept out of the tree.
# Anchored with a leading slash so it does NOT also swallow
# app/src/bundled/assets/models/, whose .gguf is covered by the *.gguf rule above
# but which may hold tracked files later. See docs/REVAMP_PLAN.md section 7.1.
/models/

